# Wikipedia contributors, "Kabyle grammar", English Wikipedia, oldid 1383353682,
# section Prepositions, table "Kabyle prepositions":
#   "ar -- 'until'"
# Tatoeba 8875919 "Sya ar ddurt i d-iteddun, ad nebdu." (from now until next week).
ar
# Native answer, chronologia#1489 (comment 7218700864): "seg letnayen alamma d lexmis" =
# "seg letnayen ar lexmis" (from Monday to Thursday).
alamma d
